{"id": "1801784", "name": "חקירת פונקציה – מנה עם שורש ריבועי", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "ff", "params": ["x"], "body": "mm/sqrt(quadratic)"}, {"name": "notff", "params": ["x"], "body": "mm/sqrt(-quadratic)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; line-height: 1.55; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3396485_EXTREMA_FUNCTIONSTUDY_V6_VISIBLE_VALIDATION\">\n<div style=\"background: #f4f1f5; border: 1px solid #d9d1dd; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #4b1f6f;\">חקירת פונקציה – מנה עם שורש ריבועי</strong></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">הפונקציה</strong>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">תחום ההגדרה</strong>\n<p>כתבו את התחום כביטוי לוגי ב־\\(\\displaystyle x\\). אפשר להשתמש ב־<code>and</code> וב־<code>or</code>.</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">אפסי הנגזרת</strong>\n<p>האם קיימת נקודה בתחום שבה הנגזרת מתאפסת?</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">גבולות בקצות התחום</strong>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 6px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to\\beta^{{CT:1}}}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 6px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to\\alpha^{{CT:2}}}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans5]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">בחרו את הגרף</strong>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>גרף 1<br>{{CT:3}}</td>\n<td>גרף 2<br>{{CT:4}}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>גרף 3<br>{{CT:5}}</td>\n<td>גרף 4<br>{{CT:6}}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans8]]</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stack-required-validation\">[[validation:ans2]][[validation:ans8]]</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; line-height: 1.55; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3396485_EXTREMA_FUNCTIONSTUDY_V6_VISIBLE_VALIDATION\">\n<div style=\"background: #f4f1f5; border: 1px solid #d9d1dd; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</strong></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון</strong>\n<p>נסמן \\(\\displaystyle q\\left(x\\right)={{CT:7}}\\). תחום ההגדרה נקבע על ידי \\(\\displaystyle q\\left(x\\right)&gt;0\\).</p>\n<p>הנגזרת מתאפסת בנקודת האמצע רק כאשר נקודה זו נמצאת בתחום, ולכן התשובה היא <strong>{{CT:8}}</strong>.</p>\n<p>בקצות התחום המכנה שואף לאפס מצד חיובי, ולכן הגבולות הם {{CT:9}} ו־{{CT:10}}. הגרף הנכון הוא גרף {{CT:11}}.</p>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 24, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "[[BASIC-ALGEBRA]]", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 24, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 24, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans8", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "X:x;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ffDomainOfDef", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.2, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Resu